WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.500
Episode 13

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.500
Hurry, Yamato<i>!!
</i>Earth is Suffering<i>!!</i>

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.500
( Air date: Dec 29, 1974 )

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.700
Goodbye, Earth.{Saraba chikyuu yo}

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.500
A ship is taking off...{Tabidatsu fune wa}

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:40.650
...it's the space battleship Yamato.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:40.270
Space Battleship

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:40.270
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:44.100
It's about to take off to Iscandar...

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:48.510
...carrying the fate of humanity.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:54.900
We'll return for sure.{Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to}

00:00:55.400 --> 00:01:03.700
Smile back at the people waving their hands.{te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae}

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:10.500
Leaving the Galactic System and
taking a long journey to Iscandar.{Ginga wo hanare Iscandar he harubaru nozomu}

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:17.200
Space battleship Yamato!{Ucyuu senkan yamato}

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:40.300
In December 2199, the space battleship
Yamato was flying through space.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:44.880
While being obstructed by unexpected
Gamilus traps and natural phenomena...

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:47.250
...it continues its
journey to Iscandar.

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:52.180
{MAN ICHI}If they fail, it will mean the total
extinction of all people on Earth...

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:55.360
{MAN ICHI}...who are waiting for
the Yamato's return.

00:01:55.360 --> 00:02:01.530
{IMA}Even now, radioactive poison is
driving mankind to the verge of death.

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:05.820
Hurry, space battleship Yamato.

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:16.430
Planet Gamilus

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:16.930
Meanwhile, on the
planet Gamilus...

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:25.880
Desler Palace

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:44.800
Lord Desler, Admiral Domel has
victoriously returned from the Ruby Line.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.180
Ah, I see.

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:50.180
Domel !  Domel !

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:55.280
Domel !  Domel !

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:54.980
Admiral Domel

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:58.880
Domel !

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:02.630
Long live Domel !

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:06.810
Long live Lord Desler !

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:11.810
Long live Lord Desler !

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:16.870
Long live Lord Desler !

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:39.180
My Lord,
I happened to hear...

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:42.930
...that the Yamato destroyed the Pluto
base and has left its solar system.

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:47.280
It should still be strolling
around in the galactic system.

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:49.530
I've been teasing them.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:53.730
My Lord, may I
take care of it ?

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:57.530
I guess I'll have to
give you another medal...

00:03:57.530 --> 00:04:00.650
...but you may do so as
a part of your vacation.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:01.960
Yes, sir.
Thank you.

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:19.940
Meanwhile, Kodai and Kato were each leading
five Black Tigers to secure their course.

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:31.660
Unidentified flying object, detected.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.380
That doesn't
tell me anything.

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:34.780
I know.

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:38.330
Bearing point AX 11,
speed, 8 space knots.

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:39.150
Roger.

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:42.180
Hey, don't forget to repeat.

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:44.380
You're such a pain.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:49.270
Bearing point AX 11,
speed, 8 space knots.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:59.120
Alright, initiate
crossfire operation.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:26.890
No, you're not
getting away.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:34.000
That's next,
here I come.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.800
Kato, don't pursue
them too far.

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.030
Say what ?

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:40.100
If even one escapes
it'll cause us trouble later.

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:41.680
That's an order.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.760
Understood,
Chief Combat Commander.

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:46.890
Besides, let's capture
that space boat.

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:48.120
Okay, got it.

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.190
Black Tigers,
return to the ship.

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:54.830
Kodai and Kato will capture the
disabled Gamilus space boat.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:03.480
Kato, we'll shoot a tow rope
from both sides.  Don't miss it.

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:04.250
Roger.

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:22.980
Kodai, the pilot woke up.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:26.930
Move away, Kodai.  I'll shoot the
head off that Gamilus bastard.

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:31.430
You're too hot blooded.
Anyway, he can't escape.

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:34.480
He's a live Gamilusian,
so he'll be a valuable sample.

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:38.730
I see, just like the Chief Combat
Commander.  You think ahead.

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:48.580
They did it.

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.820
{GAMILUS}Now we'll learn
the secrets of Gamilus.

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:55.870
Damn, that Gamilus boat
is getting more attention.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:07:00.900
Really.  They could've said,
"good job" or something.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.030
Good job.

00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:05.460
You two brought in
something useful.

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:09.140
Hey everyone, move it, move it !
Stand aside !

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:16.980
He'll be my first alien examination.
He's such a lucky fellow.

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:19.330
He must think
it's a nuisance.

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:23.120
Now, let me study the
inside of that Gamilus boat.

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:29.400
Don't stare at it,
you might be bitten.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:31.840
I'll show you later.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:34.480
Darn.
You're so mean.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:38.710
I'm so hungry.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:42.460
Let's eat quickly,
then go see it.

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:44.630
You're so into it.

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:48.950
But we don't have any
information on Gamilusians.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:53.480
You want to know what
he's like, don't you ?

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:00.840
Sterilization complete.

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:04.580
Hey, Chief.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:07.630
You guys are here, too ?
What happened to the first bridge ?

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.600
The Captain is
taking care of it.

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:12.610
That Gamilus guy
is really popular.

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:17.530
Hey, there're so many visitors.
How is he ?

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.100
He's still
under examination.

00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:22.680
Is Dr. Sado doing alright ?

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:24.810
He must be messing with
it out of curiosity.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.580
That's so true.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:30.580
I wonder what
Gamilusians are like.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:34.480
Judging from their technology,
they must be highly intelligent.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:37.070
Then it's got to
have a big head, right ?

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:41.030
But it's so weird for a
vet to examine an alien.

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:43.810
But aren't Gamilusians beasts ?

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:47.510
That's right.  Otherwise, they
wouldn't have done such cruel acts.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.450
He's coming out.

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:11.880
This's so frustrating !
Can't you do it more quickly ?!

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:13.640
Dr. Sado, hurry up.

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:14.670
Hey !

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:15.780
Quiet.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:18.580
He's taking
off the mask.

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:19.380
What ?

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:19.380
What ?

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:44.480
Hey, he's human.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:49.380
That's impossible !  There's no
way a human could be so cruel !

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:50.380
That's right !

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:54.600
But look.
He's no different from us.

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.230
Examination, complete.

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:07.170
Pulse, 90.  Respiration,
15 times per minute.

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:13.170
{KETSUEKI}Blood content, 12,000 leucocytes,
brain volume 1600 cubic centimeters.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:18.070
{KOKYUU}Breathing air content, oxygen 20%,
carbon dioxide 2%...

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:22.360
He's just like us.

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:27.090
He's human, after all.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:29.160
He's no different from us.

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:31.370
Yeah, except for
the blue skin.

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:34.720
Kodai...!

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:45.330
What's wrong, Kodai ?
What're you...?

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:56.290
Kodai, what are you doing ?

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:02.630
K...Kodai !

00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:03.130
Kodai !

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:03.960
Kodai !

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:05.130
Kodai, don't !

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:06.120
Kodai...

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:09.480
Why you...!

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:28.330
In 2192, Kodai Susumu was
a middle school student.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:32.780
He grew up in a village surrounded by
beautiful scenery on the Miura Peninsula.

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:37.380
{SONO}On that day, he was waiting for
his brother, Mamoru, with their mother.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:40.880
{CHIKYUU}A mysterious planet had just
started attacking Earth...

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:45.030
{CHIKYUU}...and the Defense Force was
formed to protect the peace.

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:50.580
Susumu's brother, Mamoru, had volunteered to join the Defense Force junior officer academy.

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.660
Welcome home, Mamoru.

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:58.330
I'm back.

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:01.230
It's been a while, Mother.
How have you been ?

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:04.260
You look more mature after
not seeing you for a while.

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:05.460
Welcome back, Brother.

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:09.090
You have pimples, Susumu.

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:10.290
Hey, don't.

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:32.980
Hey Mamoru, did you hear
anything at the academy ?

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:38.380
Like, who's attacking cities
around the world with meteor bombs ?

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:41.580
Well, I'm only a cadet, so...

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:44.430
Fortunately, Japan
hasn't been attacked...

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:46.110
...but we don't know how much
longer we'll remain safe.

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:48.680
I'm prepared.

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:51.980
I can go to space any time
and fight this demon.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:55.250
But we don't
know who they are.

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:04.180
Susumu...

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:05.310
Susumu, are you there ?

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:14.210
Susumu, what's wrong ?
He's finally home.

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:16.430
They only need him.

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:17.670
Susumu...

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:20.600
They're happy just
to be with him.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:25.270
Susumu, you can be near
your father and I all the time.

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:30.790
{MAMORU}But he can only be around for
five or six days during his leave.

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:33.980
You understand, don't you ?

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:38.110
Your father and I can be with 
him while he's on leave, right ?

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:31.430
In the year 2192,
on April 20th...

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:35.880
...Japan became the victim of a random
meteor bomb attack for the first time.

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:44.430
The meteor bomb
that fell nearby...

00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:48.830
...seems to have revitalized
Mt. Fuji's volcanic activity.

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:06.580
Dammit...

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:07.620
How terrible !{What a mess...}

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:11.230
Mamoru, you have a phone
call from the academy.

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:12.640
Okay.

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:16.110
Mt. Fuji erupted ?
We're gonna be in trouble.

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:17.480
I wonder what's
gonna happen.

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:20.580
Okay, I see.
I'll return immediately.

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:23.480
Mother, I have to go back at once.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:25.100
Mamoru...

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:27.020
Mother, take care.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:28.940
You, too.

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:44.130
The meteor bomb attack lasted for many
months, devastating the entire world.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:16:01.330
A few dozen meteor bombs fell on Japan,
and the islands were devastated.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:04.930
{TOKINI}It was now
the summer of 2193.

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:09.320
The construction of underground cities
accelerated even faster in Japan.

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:12.580
{SUSUMU}Like a tidal wave...

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:16.010
{SUSUMU}...the effect of the bombing was nearing
to Miura Peninsula, Susumu's homeland.

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:20.430
{KAKU}The schools became hospitals, and
the teachers, parents, students...

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:22.780
{KAKU}...and all the neighbors had
to work as temporary nurses.

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:45.980
The attacks from the unknown
planet became more frequent...

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:48.910
Earth Defense Force
Kanto Regional Base

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:48.910
...and the Earth Defense Force
was more and more active.

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:57.830
Hey, Susumu !

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.070
Over here !

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:02.230
Brother !

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:06.910
Father and Mother are well ?

00:17:06.910 --> 00:17:10.030
Yes. She wanted
you to eat this.

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:11.960
Oh, sushi?

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:15.910
Mother's sushi tastes great.
Susumu, you can eat some, too.

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:22.470
Brother, how many times
have you flown in space ?

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:26.480
Since graduating from the academy,
I've been in two real combat engagements.

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:30.450
Besides, how is everything after
the meteor bomb attack ?

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:36.440
Actually, we're going to move
to the underground city soon.

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:38.670
Father went to file
the paperwork today.

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:39.840
I see.

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:44.200
So I came to
say goodbye today.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:47.680
Susumu, after Father and Mother
escape to a safe place...

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:49.180
...why don't you volunteer
and join the academy ?

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:51.660
What's wrong ?

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:54.420
That's right.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:57.610
You've hated fighting since you
were very little.  You're a pacifist.

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:00.080
Sorry, Brother.

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:03.480
It's okay.  Make sure you take care
of Father and Mother, alright ?

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:26.980
People escaped from the
radioactive poison on the surface...

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:29.380
...by moving to the
underground cities.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:49.330
The paperwork is done,
and we can move any time.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:50.870
That's good.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:52.870
Where's Susumu ?

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:57.680
He said he'd be on the 4 o'clock bus,
so I have to go pick him up soon.

00:18:58.640 --> 00:19:02.530
I'd better go, too.  I haven't been
able to spend time with him lately.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:15.980
Do you remember how we got
engaged under that tree ?

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:20.780
That was when you were
waiting for a bus to go home.

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:23.810
I wish this scenery
would never change.

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:35.900
I wonder what happened ?
He isn't here.

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:37.900
I wonder...

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:16.430
My home's in
that direction...

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:17.490
Mother...

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:21.380
Mother !

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:46.860
It's Mother's...

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:50.530
Mother !

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:03.500
Don't.

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:07.010
What're you doing ?
Stop.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:15.730
Kodai, no matter
what the reason...

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:18.570
...if you torture a prisoner, you
know what'll happen, don't you ?

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:22.670
Long live my Lord !

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.580
Idiot !

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:33.900
If you're human, you should
know the value of life !

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:50.310
Several days have passed.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:56.680
Okita tried to obtain information
from the obedient prisoner...

00:21:56.680 --> 00:22:00.770
{MATTAN}...but the low ranking soldier knew
nothing about the true Gamilus.

00:22:02.230 --> 00:22:05.190
Mr. Sanada, did you finish
repairing his space boat ?

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:06.080
Yes.

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:08.270
Kodai, release him.

00:22:09.640 --> 00:22:15.080
Considering Yamato's food supply situation,
we can't afford any extra consumption.

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:15.950
Understood.

00:22:18.340 --> 00:22:19.130
Kodai.

00:22:19.410 --> 00:22:21.050
Sir ?

00:22:21.050 --> 00:22:23.930
Give him a little food, okay ?

00:22:23.930 --> 00:22:24.860
Aye, sir.

00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:30.630
Hey.

00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:38.290
It's food.  Take it.

00:22:49.580 --> 00:22:50.580
Now, take off.

00:23:13.340 --> 00:23:15.800
The Gamilus soldier flew away.

00:23:16.530 --> 00:23:20.080
Meanwhile, Earth is
suffering even more.

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:25.530
Hurry, Yamato, for the sake of the people
who are desperately waiting for your return.

00:23:25.530 --> 00:23:28.620
Mankind will be
extinct in 305 days.

00:23:28.990 --> 00:23:32.710
Mankind will be
extinct in 305 days.

00:23:30.480 --> 00:23:35.950
305 days left till the destruction of Earth

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:43.340
Okita Juzo:

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:43.340
Naya Goro

00:23:43.080 --> 00:23:51.680
A girl was waving her red scarf.{Anoko ga futteita makka na scarf}

00:23:43.610 --> 00:23:48.850
Mori Yuki:

00:23:43.610 --> 00:23:48.850
Asagami Yoko

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:54.350
Kodai's Father:

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:54.350
Yada Kouji

00:23:51.680 --> 00:24:00.480
Who was that for ?{Dareno tame da to omotte iruka}

00:23:54.890 --> 00:24:04.390
Notes:
A Gamilus solider was captured for the first time, and the Yamato crew examined him. The captured soldier was alright on the ship.

00:23:54.890 --> 00:24:04.390
The Gamilusian people on the main planet can't survive without radioactive air, so he must be altered to suit the Earth environment, despite his skin color.

00:24:00.480 --> 00:24:08.780
It doesn't matter who it was for...{Dare no tame demo ii ja nai ka}

00:24:04.390 --> 00:24:14.390
Note:
Shultz and the rest on the Pluto Base could
have been modified, or they might be
immigrants.

00:24:04.390 --> 00:24:14.390
Note:
In the flashback, it was shown that Kodai was from Miura Peninsula, and when he was twelve in 2192, Japan was attacked by a meteor bomb.

00:24:08.780 --> 00:24:17.680
...everyone should take it as theirs.{Minna sono ki de ireba ii}

